{"id":"6.3","title":"Hva gjorde du i fritida i hjemlandet?","audio":"audio/6.3.mp3","duration":152.83,"synthetic":false,"sentences":[{"id":0,"start":0.15,"end":6.17,"text":"6.3 Hva gjorde du i fritida i hjemlandet?","heading":true,"zh":"6.3 你在祖国时空闲时间做什么？","words":[[0,3,0.15,1.53,"6.3"],[4,7,2.78,3.46,"hva"],[8,14,3.46,3.96,"gjorde"],[15,17,3.96,4.2,"du"],[18,19,4.2,4.4,"i"],[20,27,4.4,5.0,"fritida"],[28,29,5.0,5.34,"i"],[30,40,5.34,6.09,"hjemlandet"]]},{"id":1,"start":9.63,"end":20.15,"text":"I fritida var jeg ofte ute og danset med venner, eller vi gikk på konsert. Jeg spilte også volleyball, og noen ganger gikk jeg på shopping med venninner.","speaker":"Viola","zh":"空闲时我常和朋友们出去跳舞，或者我们去听音乐会。我还打排球，有时候和女性朋友们去逛街购物。","words":[[0,1,9.69,9.88,"i"],[2,9,9.88,10.5,"fritida"],[10,13,10.5,10.62,"var"],[14,17,10.62,10.78,"jeg"],[18,22,10.78,11.12,"ofte"],[23,26,11.12,11.36,"ute"],[27,29,11.36,11.46,"og"],[30,36,11.46,11.98,"danset"],[37,40,11.98,12.14,"med"],[41,47,12.14,12.68,"venner"],[49,54,13.1,13.52,"eller"],[55,57,13.52,13.62,"vi"],[58,62,13.62,13.82,"gikk"],[63,65,13.82,13.94,"på~738db97cac32"],[66,73,13.94,14.68,"konsert"],[75,78,15.68,15.84,"jeg"],[79,85,15.84,16.14,"spilte"],[86,90,16.14,16.4,"også"],[91,101,16.4,17.13,"volleyball"],[103,105,17.52,17.64,"og"],[106,110,17.64,17.9,"noen~c766e2ef794d"],[111,117,17.9,18.48,"ganger"],[118,122,18.48,18.64,"gikk"],[123,126,18.64,18.76,"jeg"],[127,129,18.76,18.9,"på~443011216d88"],[130,138,18.9,19.34,"shopping"],[139,142,19.34,19.48,"med"],[143,152,19.48,20.0,"venninner"]]},{"id":2,"start":24.18,"end":41.92,"text":"I Polen trente jeg på treningssenter tre ganger i uka sammen med venner. Vi pleide også å gå på fotballkamp. Nå ser jeg bare fotball på tv, og jeg trener alltid alene.","speaker":"Marek","zh":"在波兰时，我每周和朋友们去健身房锻炼三次。我们还常去看足球赛。现在我只在电视上看足球，而且总是一个人锻炼。","words":[[0,1,24.24,24.42,"i"],[2,7,24.42,25.02,"polen~488e57c60a08"],[8,14,25.2,25.74,"trente"],[15,18,25.74,26.2,"jeg"],[19,21,26.2,26.36,"på"],[22,36,26.36,27.52,"treningssenter"],[37,40,27.66,28.18,"tre"],[41,47,28.18,28.8,"ganger"],[48,49,28.8,28.92,"i~82e4f1cd42dc"],[50,53,28.92,29.43,"uka"],[54,60,29.74,30.1,"sammen"],[61,64,30.1,30.24,"med"],[65,71,30.24,30.77,"venner"],[73,75,32.78,32.98,"vi"],[76,82,32.98,33.4,"pleide"],[83,87,33.4,33.88,"også"],[88,89,34.1,34.22,"å~0583da7a620a"],[90,92,34.22,34.4,"gå"],[93,95,34.4,34.58,"på~af536c349e1a"],[96,107,34.58,35.58,"fotballkamp"],[109,111,36.78,37.09,"nå~d531d47a7712"],[112,115,37.48,37.72,"ser"],[116,119,37.72,37.86,"jeg"],[120,124,37.86,38.12,"bare"],[125,132,38.12,38.66,"fotball"],[133,135,38.66,38.84,"på"],[136,138,38.84,39.38,"tv"],[140,142,39.78,39.88,"og"],[143,146,39.88,40.06,"jeg"],[147,153,40.06,40.56,"trener~08cfad369757"],[154,160,40.56,41.17,"alltid~867f85a8b647"],[161,166,41.36,41.77,"alene"]]},{"id":3,"start":46.22,"end":55.08,"text":"Jeg inviterte ofte venner hjem til meg. Jeg bodde i en stor by, og vi pleide å gå på diskotek i helgene.","speaker":"Sompit","zh":"我经常请朋友到我家来。我住在一个大城市，周末我们常去迪厅。","words":[[0,3,46.28,46.66,"jeg"],[4,13,46.66,47.4,"inviterte"],[14,18,47.4,47.92,"ofte"],[19,25,47.92,48.54,"venner"],[26,30,48.54,48.78,"hjem~e7045642e9ab"],[31,34,48.78,48.94,"til"],[35,38,48.94,49.3,"meg"],[40,43,50.38,50.6,"jeg"],[44,49,50.6,50.92,"bodde"],[50,51,50.92,51.02,"i"],[52,54,51.02,51.24,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[55,59,51.24,51.64,"stor"],[60,62,51.64,51.95,"by"],[64,66,52.48,52.58,"og"],[67,69,52.58,52.72,"vi"],[70,76,52.72,53.18,"pleide"],[77,78,53.18,53.26,"å~0583da7a620a"],[79,81,53.26,53.42,"gå"],[82,84,53.42,53.56,"på~cbd02572c370"],[85,93,53.56,54.34,"diskotek"],[94,95,54.34,54.46,"i~898371af17e5"],[96,103,54.46,54.93,"helgene"]]},{"id":4,"start":58.98,"end":75.27,"text":"Jeg laget ofte mat i hjemlandet. Mamma lærte meg mye. Jeg likte å lage mat sammen med henne. Jeg var mye sammen med venninner, og vi skravlet og sang. Av og til var vi på fester og danset.","speaker":"Hawa","zh":"在祖国时我经常做饭。妈妈教了我很多。我喜欢和她一起做饭。我常和女性朋友们在一起，我们聊天、唱歌。有时候我们去参加聚会、跳舞。","words":[[0,3,59.04,59.38,"jeg"],[4,9,59.38,59.8,"laget~8790a82fb4ba"],[10,14,59.8,60.26,"ofte"],[15,18,60.26,60.74,"mat"],[19,20,60.74,60.82,"i"],[21,31,60.82,61.58,"hjemlandet"],[33,38,62.42,62.84,"mamma"],[39,44,62.84,63.22,"lærte~a76f12f208de"],[45,48,63.22,63.4,"meg"],[49,52,63.4,63.88,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[54,57,64.72,64.88,"jeg"],[58,63,64.88,65.2,"likte"],[64,65,65.2,65.28,"å~0583da7a620a"],[66,70,65.28,65.58,"lage"],[71,74,65.58,65.96,"mat"],[75,81,65.96,66.24,"sammen"],[82,85,66.24,66.36,"med"],[86,91,66.36,66.82,"henne"],[93,96,68.0,68.18,"jeg"],[97,100,68.18,68.34,"var"],[101,104,68.34,68.68,"mye~933c5a923198"],[105,111,68.68,69.02,"sammen"],[112,115,69.02,69.18,"med"],[116,125,69.18,69.82,"venninner"],[127,129,70.0,70.12,"og"],[130,132,70.12,70.28,"vi"],[133,141,70.28,70.9,"skravlet"],[142,144,70.9,71.04,"og"],[145,149,71.04,71.52,"sang"],[151,153,72.5,72.68,"av~26a687fec87a"],[154,156,72.68,72.8,"og"],[157,160,72.8,73.2,"til~69fe6862a430"],[161,164,73.4,73.56,"var"],[165,167,73.56,73.7,"vi"],[168,170,73.7,73.88,"på"],[171,177,73.88,74.44,"fester"],[178,180,74.44,74.56,"og"],[181,187,74.56,75.12,"danset"]]},{"id":5,"start":79.41,"end":93.18,"text":"Jeg hadde ikke mye fritid i hjemlandet. Jeg jobbet nesten hele tida, men av og til spilte jeg kort med venner. I helgene pleide vi å dra på piknik med barna.","speaker":"Yousef","zh":"在祖国时我没有多少空闲时间。我几乎一直在工作，不过有时会和朋友们打牌。周末我们常带孩子们去野餐。","words":[[0,3,79.47,79.88,"jeg"],[4,9,79.88,80.18,"hadde"],[10,14,80.18,80.42,"ikke"],[15,18,80.42,80.72,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[19,25,80.72,81.36,"fritid"],[26,27,81.36,81.44,"i"],[28,38,81.44,82.18,"hjemlandet"],[40,43,82.98,83.2,"jeg"],[44,50,83.2,83.62,"jobbet"],[51,57,83.62,84.04,"nesten"],[58,62,84.04,84.32,"hele"],[63,67,84.32,84.78,"tida"],[69,72,85.62,86.0,"men"],[73,75,86.12,86.3,"av~26a687fec87a"],[76,78,86.3,86.44,"og"],[79,82,86.44,86.82,"til~69fe6862a430"],[83,89,86.94,87.26,"spilte"],[90,93,87.26,87.46,"jeg"],[94,98,87.46,88.0,"kort~4b3edda54db4"],[99,102,88.0,88.12,"med"],[103,109,88.12,88.64,"venner"],[111,112,89.82,89.96,"i~898371af17e5"],[113,120,89.96,90.62,"helgene"],[121,127,90.84,91.2,"pleide"],[128,130,91.2,91.34,"vi"],[131,132,91.34,91.42,"å~0583da7a620a"],[133,136,91.42,91.62,"dra"],[137,139,91.62,91.78,"på~b4c6c2ee8434"],[140,146,91.78,92.48,"piknik"],[147,150,92.48,92.62,"med"],[151,156,92.62,93.03,"barna"]]},{"id":6,"start":97.24,"end":109.13,"text":"Jeg spilte ofte fotball med venner i hjemlandet. Vi pleide også å gå på kino. Noen ganger dro vi til sjøen og koste oss på stranda.","speaker":"Biniam","zh":"在祖国时我经常和朋友们踢足球。我们以前也常去看电影。有时我们去海边，在海滩上玩得很开心。","words":[[0,3,97.3,97.74,"jeg"],[4,10,97.74,98.2,"spilte"],[11,15,98.2,98.58,"ofte"],[16,23,98.58,99.34,"fotball"],[24,27,99.34,99.5,"med"],[28,34,99.5,99.98,"venner"],[35,36,99.98,100.06,"i"],[37,47,100.06,100.8,"hjemlandet"],[49,51,101.8,102.0,"vi"],[52,58,102.0,102.44,"pleide"],[59,63,102.44,102.8,"også"],[64,65,102.8,102.9,"å~0583da7a620a"],[66,68,102.9,103.1,"gå"],[69,71,103.1,103.28,"på~c0dfbb17841e"],[72,76,103.28,103.86,"kino"],[78,82,105.12,105.52,"noen~c766e2ef794d"],[83,89,105.52,106.12,"ganger"],[90,93,106.12,106.44,"dro"],[94,96,106.44,106.58,"vi"],[97,100,106.58,106.84,"til"],[101,106,106.84,107.44,"sjøen"],[107,109,107.44,107.58,"og"],[110,115,107.58,108.08,"koste"],[116,119,108.08,108.32,"oss"],[120,122,108.32,108.48,"på"],[123,130,108.48,108.98,"stranda"]]},{"id":7,"start":112.21,"end":114.41,"text":"Hva gjorde de i fritida?","zh":"他们空闲时做了什么？","words":[[0,3,112.27,112.76,"hva"],[4,10,112.76,113.2,"gjorde"],[11,13,113.2,113.56,"de"],[14,15,113.56,113.7,"i"],[16,23,113.7,114.26,"fritida"]]},{"id":8,"start":116.09,"end":117.65,"text":"De danset sammen.","zh":"他们一起跳舞。","words":[[0,2,116.16,116.48,"de"],[3,9,116.48,117.02,"danset"],[10,16,117.02,117.5,"sammen"]]},{"id":9,"start":119.52,"end":120.86,"text":"De spilte sjakk.","zh":"他们下国际象棋。","words":[[0,2,119.58,119.78,"de"],[3,9,119.78,120.2,"spilte"],[10,15,120.2,120.71,"sjakk"]]},{"id":10,"start":122.9,"end":124.49,"text":"Hun jobbet i hagen.","zh":"她在花园里干活。","words":[[0,3,122.96,123.32,"hun"],[4,10,123.32,123.72,"jobbet"],[11,12,123.72,123.82,"i"],[13,18,123.82,124.34,"hagen"]]},{"id":11,"start":126.06,"end":128.68,"text":"De trente på treningssenter.","zh":"他们在健身房锻炼。","words":[[0,2,126.12,126.36,"de"],[3,9,126.36,127.26,"trente"],[10,12,127.26,127.56,"på"],[13,27,127.56,128.53,"treningssenter"]]},{"id":12,"start":130.68,"end":132.31,"text":"De spilte dataspill.","zh":"他们玩电脑游戏。","words":[[0,2,130.74,130.96,"de"],[3,9,130.96,131.4,"spilte"],[10,19,131.4,132.16,"dataspill"]]},{"id":13,"start":134.55,"end":136.72,"text":"Jenta var på fisketur.","zh":"女孩去钓鱼了。","words":[[0,5,134.61,135.28,"jenta"],[6,9,135.28,135.62,"var"],[10,12,135.62,135.78,"på"],[13,21,135.78,136.56,"fisketur"]]},{"id":14,"start":139.18,"end":141.39,"text":"Familien var på piknik.","zh":"一家人去野餐了。","words":[[0,8,139.24,140.06,"familien"],[9,12,140.06,140.38,"var"],[13,15,140.38,140.56,"på"],[16,22,140.56,141.24,"piknik"]]},{"id":15,"start":143.48,"end":145.38,"text":"Jentene strikket.","zh":"女孩们在织毛线。","words":[[0,7,143.54,144.36,"jentene"],[8,16,144.36,145.22,"strikket"]]},{"id":16,"start":146.8,"end":148.47,"text":"De spilte kort.","zh":"他们在打牌。","words":[[0,2,146.86,147.3,"de"],[3,9,147.3,147.8,"spilte"],[10,14,147.8,148.31,"kort~4b3edda54db4"]]}],"lexicon":{"6.3":{"lemma":"6.3","zh":"第 6.3 节","pos":"编号","ref":null,"clip":null,"kind":"section"},"alene":{"lemma":"alene","zh":"独自一人","pos":"副词","ref":"2-054","clip":"pronunciation/3c24fdbe3fdf986a62b0.mp3"},"alltid":{"lemma":"alltid","zh":"总是；一直","pos":"副词","ref":"basics:frequency:alltid","clip":"pronunciation/fca234bf04bff719be01.mp3"},"av":{"lemma":"av","zh":"……的；从；由","pos":"介词","ref":"pa-vei-3-029","clip":"pronunciation/27a26bca625b22397190.mp3"},"bare":{"lemma":"bare","zh":"只；仅仅；就","pos":"副词","ref":"basics:frequency:bare","clip":"pronunciation/9b828d53402d6e332ef0.mp3"},"barna":{"lemma":"barn","zh":"孩子","pos":"名词","ref":"basics:family:barn","form":"复数定指","clip":n